{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39576","headline":"访建阳马驿僧亚齐 · 翁承赞","name":"访建阳马驿僧亚齐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧萧风雨建阳溪，溪畔维舟访亚齐。\n一轴新诗劒潭北，十年旧识华山西。\n吟魂惜向江村老，空性元知世路迷。\n应笑乘轺青琐客，此时无暇听猿啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}